{"pin":"BB00432","subcodes":[{"code":"BB00432","anchor":"","first_line":"O God, unto Thee be praise! There is no God but He, the Hearer of prayer, the Ever-Bestowing, the All-Bountiful, the Lord of Names. O God, unto Thee be praise! There is no God but He, the Sender of Tablets, the Mover of winds [3.5s]","first_line_orig":"بسمه العلی الاعلی. اللهم لک الحمد لا الله الا هو سامع الدعاء و دائم العطاء و واسع الآلاء و مالک الاسماء اللهم لک الحمد لا الله الا هو مرسل الالواح و محرک الرواح   ","language":"Ara","word_count":"330","subjects":"@station of the Manifestation of God, @power and sovereignty of God; omnipotence of God, @justice and wrath of God","notes":" \u003ca href=\"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/b/browne_catalogue_manuscripts_one.pdf#page=23\"\u003eJRAS.454\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"https://digital.soas.ac.uk/content/LO/AA/00/56/59/00001/PDF.pdf#page=82\"\u003eBRHL.60\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"https://bahai-library.com/browne_materials_study_babi\"\u003eMSBR.206-207\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://www.loomofreality.org/sources/SRC.pdf#page=47\"\u003eSRC.195\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[{"language":"mi","lang_name":"Maori"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BYC_tablets.017.09-018.09","source":"BYC_tablets","locator":"017.09-018.09","url":"http://bayanic.com/lib/scan/sacred/Point/Tablets"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"CMB_F14.004v02-005v02","source":"CMB_F14","locator":"004v02-005v02"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA_6009C:227-231","source":"INBA_6009C:227-231"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"MKI4500.120r-120v","source":"MKI4500","locator":"120r-120v","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/MKI-34-Ae-Arabi-4500.pdf"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"MKI4511.020v-022v","source":"MKI4511","locator":"020v-022v","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/MKI-34-Ae-Arabi-4511.pdf"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"PR03.045r18-045v08","source":"PR03","locator":"045r18-045v08","url":"https://findingaids.princeton.edu/catalog/C0723-